---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const canonical = 'https://colotopia.com/en/about/';
const altUrl = 'https://colotopia.com/fr/a-propos/';
---

<BaseLayout
  locale="en"
  title="About Colotopia"
  description="Colotopia is an independent website dedicated to free printable coloring pages for kids and adults. Learn how the drawings are created, reviewed and prepared for printing."
  canonical={canonical}
  altUrl={altUrl}
>
  <article class="legal-page">
    <h1>About Colotopia</h1>

    <p class="lead">
      Colotopia is an independent website offering hundreds of free printable coloring pages,
      designed for both children and adults.
    </p>

    <h2>Our mission</h2>
    <p>Help you choose a drawing, download an A4 PDF and print it for a coloring activity
      at home, at school or in a workshop. The coloring pages are available without an account
      or subscription.</p>

    <h2>How the drawings are prepared</h2>
    <p>Colotopia uses AI-assisted image generation tools to create some of its illustrations.
      Drawings are then reviewed visually for a coherent subject, clear outlines, spaces to color
      and unwanted text. A drawing with a defect can be removed and remade.</p>
    <p>Website previews are optimized to make browsing easier. PDF downloads use the file intended
      for printing. Drawings are available for personal and educational use under our
      <a href="/en/terms/">terms of use</a>.</p>

    <h2>Who is it for?</h2>
    <p>The catalog includes simple shapes and bold outlines for beginners, animals, vehicles and
      dinosaurs, as well as mandalas, landscapes and more detailed patterns. Look at the preview
      to choose a level of detail that suits you.</p>

    <h2>An activity at your own pace</h2>
    <p>A few pencils and a sheet of paper are enough to try colors, invent a story or share an
      activity. There is no result you have to achieve: everyone can color in their own way.</p>

    <h2>An independent project</h2>
    <p>Colotopia is an independent project. Advertising can help fund hosting and the preparation
      of drawings. You can manage your consent on the website.</p>
    <p>We review and maintain the catalog, but a defect may escape our checks. If a drawing looks
      inconsistent, is difficult to print or does not load, send us its address through the
      <a href="/en/contact/">contact page</a> so we can fix it.</p>

    <h2>Contact us</h2>
    <p>
      Got a question, a suggestion, a partnership request or a report? We're listening:
      <a href="/en/contact/">contact us</a> or write to
      <a href="mailto:contact@colotopia.com">contact@colotopia.com</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .legal-page h1 {
    font-size: 2.25rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: #1f2937;
  }
  .legal-page .lead {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: #4b5563;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .legal-page h2 {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 2rem 0 0.75rem;
    color: #1f2937;
  }
  .legal-page p {
    color: #4b5563;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }
  .legal-page a {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>
